# Patient homepage lock (Solo Doc)

The solo **patient homepage** look and the **Book Appointment** CTAs are frozen as of 2026-08-05.

## Unlock phrase (required)

Do **not** change homepage UI, layout, typography, section markup, or Book Appointment button styling/placement/URL wiring unless the user explicitly says one of:

- `update patient homepage`
- `change patient homepage`

Synonyms like “tweak the home page”, “fix the hero”, “polish Conditions cards”, or drive-by refactors do **not** unlock.

## Locked files (do not edit without unlock)

- `resources/views/tenant/solo/webpage.blade.php`
- `resources/views/tenant/solo/sections/**` (hero, about_doctor, condition_library, faq, testimonials, video_gallery, …)

## Book Appointment CTA (also locked)

Homepage Book buttons must keep `tenant_safe_href(..., '/book')` so path tenants hit `/{tenant}/book` (not bare `/book`).

Do not change:

- Hero / About Doctor CTA markup or classes (`solo-cta`, etc.)
- `tenant_safe_href` → `SafeUrl::href` (or hard-coded `/book`) on those CTAs

## Still allowed without unlock

- Booking wizard, ticket, portal, outdoor screen, admin/Filament (unless the change only exists to restyle the homepage)
- Non-visual bug fixes **outside** the locked files
- Copy/CMS content edited by the doctor in Filament Web Pages (runtime data), not Blade chrome

## If asked to “improve UI” generally

Improve other surfaces (book / ticket / portal / admin). Leave the patient homepage alone and mention it is locked until they say **update/change patient homepage**.
